<title>USA: Blyth backs Q4 estimates of $0.35 a share.</title>
<headline>Blyth backs Q4 estimates of $0.35 a share.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Blyth Industries Inc said Thursday it agreed with analysts' fourth quarter earnings estimates of $0.35 per share.  </p>
<p>In a statement, Blyth said &quot;We are comfortable with Wall Street's consensus estimates for our fourth quarter ending January 31, 1997 of $0.35 per share which, if achieved, would be up 50 percent over last fiscal year's fourth quarter.&quot;</p>
</text>
